12\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757770/extras/39bccd7bd0e31f6386c2fca818eda731.webm?t=1726581212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2757770/extras/39bccd7bd0e31f6386c2fca818eda731.mp4?t=1726581212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
